  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening FAO`s Commit to Grow Equality  implementing the Int. Year of Woman Farmer 2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened and accountable CGE partnership ecosystem that fosters collaboration, attracts investment to the sector, and accelerates collective progress toward gender equality in agrifood systems.

Strengthened IYWF advocacy through the organization of inclusive events and dialogues that amplify the voices and participation of women farmers from low- and middle-income countries (LMICs), contributing to gender-responsive policy frameworks in agrifood systems</narrative>
  </description>
